<p>Aap ki Zehra s.a pay yh kaisy Zamany aye..<br> Dekhiye log mery Ghar ko Jalany aye...</p> 
<p>01. Jany soye thy Madinay kay muslaman kahan.<br> jalta dar dekh k fizza s.a yahe krte the fughan<br> Aag Derwazay ki koi to bujhany aye....</p> 
<p>02. Pasliyan toot gain mujh pay gira darwaza,<br> or Chalta howa darwazay pay zalim Guzra,<br> Zakham pehlu pay mery kitnay na janay aye..</p> 
<p>03. Taziyana mery Bazu pay laga jab baba,<br> aa gai yaad madinay main mujhy karbobala,<br> yad Abbas s.a k kattay howy shanny aye.</p> 
<p>04.Ghamzada mery gharany ko dilasa dynay,<br> koi mohsin s.a ka mujhy aya na pursa dynay,<br> log aye bhe tu bus dil ko dukhany aye...</p> 
<p>05. Jab sy Bandhi gai Haider s.a k galay mea rassi,<br> dekh kr zainab o kulsoom ko kehtay hain yehi,<br> kash tum ko koi qaidi na bannay aye..</p> 
<p>06.Ashk is baat pay Ankhoun sy Bahye jaty hain,&nbsp;<br> dekh ayi hoon main dabar kisay kehty hain,<br> Yad zainab s.a ke aseeri kay zamany aye..</p> 
<p>07. Baap ke qabr pay akber wo yay keh kr roye,<br> meri Ghurbat kay mera Bhai nahi hai koi,&nbsp;<br> kon hai sath jo zehra s.a ka nibhany aye.</p>